  "tasks": {
    "_comment": "CONFIRMED on 2026-08-03 from real markup via `node scripts/rei-task-doctor.mjs \"<contact url>\"`. The completion control is a Chakra button: aria-label='mark-as-complete', id='check-task-complete', carrying a checkmark SVG. It is HIDDEN until the task row is hovered - which is why six visibility-checked guesses all missed it and the run reported 'no completion control found inside the task row'. completeTask hovers the row first. src/rei/task-gate.mjs still refuses any selector matching delete/remove/trash/archive/cancel/discard at runtime.",
